{
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x claw log [--ts <ts>] [--debug]"
:
null
}
]
,
"--ts"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示指定时间戳或之前的日志"
,
"en"
:
"Show logs up to the specified timestamp"
}
}
,
"--debug"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示 claw 模块的 debug 日志（默认隐藏）"
,
"en"
:
"Show claw module debug logs (hidden by default)"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"日志包含所有 IM 平台的消息处理和心跳记录。\n默认显示最新日志流，并按时间戳排序。\n支持多行日志条目（如 Agent 输出）。\n默认会隐藏 `D|claw:` 的 debug 日志，使用 --debug 可显示全部。\n心搏日志带有 [HB] 前缀，便于区分。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Logs include message processing and heartbeat records for all IM platforms.\nShows latest log stream by default, sorted by timestamp.\nSupports multi-line entries (e.g. Agent output).\n`D|claw:` debug logs are hidden by default; use --debug to show them.\nHeartbeat logs are prefixed with [HB] for easy identification.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 实时查看最新日志流，排查最近的消息处理或心跳问题"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View the latest log stream in real time to troubleshoot recent message handling or heartbeat issues"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log --ts 1751174400"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 查看指定时间戳及之前的日志"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View logs up to the specified timestamp"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw log --debug"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 查看完整日志，包括 claw debug 信息"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: View full logs including claw debug information"
}
]
}

